  "goodToKnow": "Das Wohnhaus is a building in which people live, as opposed to an office, shop or industrial building. It appears in building law and property ads: Wohnhaus mit Garten. Compounds specify the type: Einfamilienhaus (single-family), Mehrfamilienhaus (apartment block). The plural has both an umlaut and an ending: die Wohnhäuser. A Nebengebäude is an outbuilding next to the Wohnhaus."
